  "description": "Play hard with the LXi 7.1, featuring 21 speeds and easy twist shifting. Go for a smooth, fast pedal on a light 6061 aluminum frame with a 30 mm suspension fork, and fast-rolling 700c wheels. You'll enjoy all the same ergonomic features as the LXi 7.2: Del Sol comfort saddle and suspension seat post, Del Sol comfort grips and adjustable stem.\nDel Sol lightweight 6061 frame with upright comfort geometry\nUltra-compliant 30mm travel suspension fork\nShimano 21 speed Tourney derailleurs with Revo twist shifters\nShimano TY301 crankset\nAdjustable angle alloy stem and lightweight alloy handlebars\nCustom Del Sol comfort plus saddle with suspension seatpost\nLightweight 32 hole alloy wheelset with doublewall rims\nSmooth rolling 700 x 38c all-purpose tires",
